  "details": "Please support shared variables that allow players in the world to synchronize and share values. Players entering the world later should be able to share the same value.\n\nWith this shared variable, it becomes easier to create Udon graphs for synchronous control of various object states.\n\nAs for the UI, I would like it to be realized by an operation that sets a shared flag for the parameter.",
